{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","封裁猎矢"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射封魔箭使一名敌人属性无法增加持续一段时间，并使目标永久降低护甲和魔抗。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","朝一名敌人发射封魔箭，造成240% + 20% ATK伤害，使敌人的属性增益效果失效持续8秒，并使目标永久降低20%护甲和魔抗，该效果不可叠加。属性增益失效的效果对首领敌人无法生效。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对暴露弱点的目标释放封魔箭时，也能击破弱点额外造成其最大生命值20%的真实伤害，该伤害不超过500% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","封魔箭伤害提高至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","封魔箭伤害提高至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","封魔箭伤害提高至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","洞察射界"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","拥有多个来自不同友军的属性降低效果的敌人会暴露弱点，因度厄的普通攻击对暴露弱点的敌人造成额外真实伤害，并且能够同时发射3枚箭矢攻击敌人。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，当敌人拥有至少3个来自不同友军的属性降低类效果时会暴露弱点，因度厄的普通攻击能击破弱点造成额外60% + 6% ATK真实伤害，同一名敌人的弱点在4秒内至多被普通攻击击破1次。\n此外，因度厄的普通攻击会同时发射3枚箭矢分别造成165% + 20% ATK伤害，优先攻击暴露弱点的不同目标，命中相同目标时后续伤害降低25%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":121,"end":127,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":117,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击每枚箭矢的伤害提高至170% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击每枚箭矢的伤害提高至175% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击每枚箭矢的伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","拘缚投网"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","将周围敌人击退至一定距离外，并扔出捕网定身一名最近的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","将周围敌人击退至距离自身2格以外的位置，随后朝距离最近的一名敌人扔出捕网，造成170% + 20% ATK伤害并将其定身5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，有敌人暴露弱点时额外提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高6%，有敌人暴露弱点时额外提高9%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高8%，有敌人暴露弱点时额外提高12%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高10%，有敌人暴露弱点时额外提高15%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","裂影破风"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","因度厄每次击破弱点后提高自身攻击速度，持续一段时间。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","因度厄每次击破弱点时使自身提高40点攻击速度，持续6秒，不可叠加。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","击破弱点时的攻击速度加成提高至50点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","因度厄的普通攻击会使目标降低20%护甲，持续6秒，不可叠加。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","击破弱点时的攻击速度加成提高至60点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“拘缚投网”发射捕网命中敌人后，因度厄击破其弱点不受冷却时间限制持续一段时间。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“拘缚投网”发射的捕网命中目标后，因度厄的普通攻击击破其弱点不受冷却时间限制，持续5秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","击破弱点的4秒内，普通攻击对被击破弱点的敌人射出的每根箭矢将附带目标最大生命值5%的物理伤害，至多不超过自身攻击力150%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","弦月"]]}